### Listar propiedades con valores por defecto
GET http://localhost:5023/api/properties
Accept: application/json

### Listar primera página con tamaño explícito
GET http://localhost:5023/api/properties?page=1&pageSize=6
Accept: application/json

### Crear propiedad sin imagen
POST http://localhost:5023/api/properties
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=realtor-create

--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Casa de prueba
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Propiedad creada sin fotografía.
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

Calle Central 123
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

250000.00
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Available
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bedroomCount"

3
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bathroomCount"

2
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="areaSquareMeters"

140.50
--realtor-create--

### Crear propiedad con PNG válido
POST http://localhost:5023/api/properties
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=realtor-create

--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Casa con fotografía
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Propiedad creada con PNG válido.
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="address"

Avenida Central 456
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="price"

320000.00
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

Available
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bedroomCount"

4
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bathroomCount"

3
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="areaSquareMeters"

180.00
--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="property.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./support/seed-data/images/properties/1.png
--realtor-create--

### Crear propiedad con JPG/JPEG válido
POST http://localhost:5023/api/properties
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=realtor-create

--realtor-create
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Casa con JPG
--realtor-create
